    hashes to the target digest nothing is written and the status is
    ``duplicate``.  Anything else records a :class:`StalePruneError`;
    an illegal archive, plan or receipt encoding or binding records an
    :class:`InvalidPruneError`; an :class:`OSError` raised while
    writing, flushing, syncing a file or directory, replacing or
    deleting is recorded for that item with its original text, the
    archive left unchanged and the retryable transaction material in
    place, and the batch continues.

    The first completion and a same-plan re-entry return the same
    signed receipt; the receipt binds the status, the complete plan,
    the checkpoint, the before/after digests, the delete and retain
    digests, the moment and version 1.  Returns a fresh list of fresh
    dicts keyed ``id``, ``receipt`` and ``error`` in input order.
